<%- include('../partials/breadcrumbs') %>

<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0; background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
    <span class="badge badge-brand" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Export Operations</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Export Logistics & Shipping Protocols</h1>
    <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      How RRE International handles container consolidation, specialized VCI oceanic packaging, customs clearance, and global ocean freight.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 4rem 0; background: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
    
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Maritime Packaging & Corrosion Protection</h2>
    <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      High-humidity sea freight transits across the Indian Ocean and Arabian Sea can induce oxidation on precision ground alloy steel pins and transmission gears if improperly packed. RRE International adheres to strict multi-layer rust-preventive standards:
    </p>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #0f172a;">Packaging Architecture</h3>
      <ol style="padding-left: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.8;">
        <li><strong>Degreasing & Ultrasonic Wash:</strong> Components are cleaned of cutting fluids.</li>
        <li><strong>VCI Dip Coating:</strong> Application of heavy-duty volatile corrosion inhibitor oil film.</li>
        <li><strong>Sealed Barrier Foil:</strong> Heavy-gauge polythene vacuum wrapping.</li>
        <li><strong>Export Wooden Crates:</strong> ISPM-15 heat-treated, fumigated timber pallets and corrugated cartons with steel band strapping.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Supported Incoterms</h2>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">FOB (Free On Board)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b;">Delivered and customs-cleared at Nhava Sheva (JNPT) or Mundra Port. Buyer selects oceanic shipping line.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">CIF (Cost, Insurance & Freight)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b;">RRE International arranges full oceanic freight and marine cargo insurance to your destination port (e.g. Jebel Ali, Jeddah, Mombasa, Durban).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/rfq" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.85rem 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
        Submit an Export Quotation Request
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
